  "releaseNotes": "TinyDispatcher 1.2.1\n\n      Fixed\n      - Generated pipelines now preserve middleware declaration order within the global, policy, and per-command layers.\n      - In affected previous versions, including 1.2.0, middleware was extracted in declaration order but later normalized by type name. When declaration and alphabetical order differed, execution order could change.\n      - Duplicate middleware registrations continue to keep their first occurrence.",
